ared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1}],"text":[{"business_id":"69R0QwXKjNDpilMgtzeLqA","review_id":"BM6396wd28mFZo6m6NgOIA","date":"2020-05-15T04:39:40","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9258498549461365,"text_excerpt":"Good food! The atmosphere is super chill and laid back. The owner is so sweet and the service is good. I always look forward to getting they're tasty tacos . The servers remember me whenever I come by. The breakfast tacos are the absolute best!!!! #thankyouthursday #yelplove"},{"business_id":"69R0QwXKjNDpilMgtzeLqA","review_id":"NSTnYmJEZNoxqNZ_9hswfw","date":"2020-01-05T15:06:09","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9053454399108887,"text_excerpt":"Can't say enough about this gem of a restaurant in the Bywater!!! Being from Austin, I had a serious craving for some breakfast tacos on my NOLA trip. I'm sure glad I got this recommendation from several locals...it sure hit the spot! My husband ordered the Migas and I ordered three scrumptious bacon, egg and cheese breakfast tacos (I also have to give a shout out to the yummy salsa). Note: They serve breakfast tacos on weekends from 8-noon."},{"business_id":"69R0QwXKjNDpilMgtzeLqA","review_id":"RftAk_ZEWQ5TOH_uMg1p3w","date":"2020-05-17T16:25:05","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9042121767997742,"text_excerpt":"The highlight of my weekend! This place is amazing! The best pour over coffee in an atmosphere that is unlike any other! It is such a beautiful relaxing atmosphere. The owner is so very nice...and will make your day! The prices are very reasonable. The coffee was only 2$, and I had a bunch of it cause it was so good (I like my coffee black so it has to be good/which this was-Coast roast beans and perfect temperature!) The breakfast tacos are berdelicious. The egg and 3 cheese blend was 3$, and there is a lot of additions for 50$ you can include (like gauc), and for a 1$ more you can add carnita which I highly recommend! A true gem in bywater! I will definitely be a regular! I am looking f..."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
